\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  God's own son who came in the flesh
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and he saved us all mankind
\par Sun of righteousness is risen
\par It's shinning in Bethlehem.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Light eternal not created
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 shinning in this heathen world
\par driving out the shadows of death
\par a new day has dawned to-day.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3. The whole world which dwelt in darkness
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  will shine bright and become light
\par  and this light which we are expecting
\par  has appeared on this our earth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.  Crown him! He our heavenly King
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  he who became our brother
\par  It is all because of us all.
\par \pard       All you on earth come, O come. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

